# Day 16 — Practice

## Practice 1 — Explain the Problem

Explain in your own words:

What problem does the AI Lead Qualification Agent demonstrate a solution for?

Expected understanding:

The system demonstrates how AI and Python can help organize enquiries, classify leads, prepare reply drafts, and track follow-ups.

## Practice 2 — Explain the Benefit

Explain:

What potential benefit does this system provide?

Expected understanding:

It can reduce repetitive lead-management work, organize information, help prioritize enquiries, and make follow-up tracking easier.

