## Practice 9 — Business Explanation

Explain the project to a non-technical person in 3–5 sentences.

Example:

This project demonstrates an AI system that helps organize customer enquiries. It can classify leads, identify priority, prepare response drafts, and track follow-ups. The dashboard helps show which leads need attention. A human reviews AI-generated responses before they are used.

## Practice 10 — Week 2 Reflection

Answer:

### What did I build?

An AI Lead Qualification Agent using Python.

### What did I learn?

How AI classification, structured output, reply drafting, follow-up tracking, storage, and a dashboard can work together.

### What was the biggest lesson?

A useful AI application requires more than an AI model. It also needs application logic, data handling, testing, and human oversight.

